# Growflow Ops — agent read protocol

1. Open `ai-lab/registry/growflow_read_surfaces/catalog.json` and pick `surface_id`.
2. Prefer Operator Desk tools / prepared `growflow_snapshot.json` / `data/*_latest.json`.
3. HTTP GET only (`:8791` or CC `/api/retail/*`). Never GraphQL at ask-time.
4. Never `POST /api/retail/refresh` from Operator Desk.
5. Writes only via approval queue + `ai-lab/registry/scripts.json` (`approval_required: true`).
6. If `fixture_suspected` or trust not healthy — state that before quoting numbers.
7. Do not invoke deprecated `growflow_sales_today` or `company_bi.run_pipeline` (use `build_company_bi_report.py`).
